# OpenAI API key used to pre-fill Settings → API Key.
# Get one at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
# ⚠️ This app is fully client-side: anything prefixed VITE_ is embedded into
# the production bundle and visible to anyone who loads the app. Use a
